engine integration:
  codex:
    wrote .codex/config.toml: added marketplaces.gabo-ai.source_type, marketplaces.gabo-ai.source, plugins."gabo@gabo-ai".enabled
  claude:
    removed .claude/settings.json agent: "gabo-assistant" (runtimes.assistant is codex)
you still need to:
  - codex: trust the project in Codex so it loads .codex/config.toml
  - codex: trust both gabo hooks in /hooks
  - codex: if Codex does not list the gabo plugin after trust, run: codex plugin marketplace add testeos-z/gabo-ai
  - codex: if Codex does not list the gabo plugin after trust, run: codex plugin add gabo@gabo-ai
